scenario: c.libjpeg-turbo compresses an RGB image with quality and decompresses it back to RGB without unsafe
requires: network
platforms: darwin, linux, windows

new directory
run: with init .
run: with get c.libjpeg-turbo
write src/main.with from libjpeg_turbo_main.with
run: with run
expect exit: 0
expect stdout contains: libjpeg-turbo ok